@startuml
title Databricks Platform Engineering POC - Architecture and Functional Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Consolas
skinparam wrapWidth 260
skinparam maxMessageSize 220

legend left
  This diagram shows:
  1) End-to-end data flow (Bronze -> Silver -> Gold -> SQL Analytics)
  2) Platform controls (Terraform, Unity Catalog grants, cluster policy)
  3) Delivery lifecycle (Jenkins CI/CD + Databricks Bundle)
  4) MLOps lifecycle (train -> register -> batch score)
  5) Databricks Genie / LLM analytics assistant flow
  6) Functional ownership for interview Q&A
endlegend

actor "Data Consumer\n(Analyst / Risk / Product)" as consumer
actor "ML Consumer\n(Risk Ops / Fraud Team)" as ml_consumer
actor "Platform Engineer\n(You)" as engineer

package "Source and Ingestion" {
  database "Raw Transaction File\nsample_data/transactions.csv" as raw_file
  component "Bronze Job\nsrc/jobs/bronze_ingest.py" as bronze_job
  database "Delta Table\nmain.poc_fintech.bronze_transactions" as bronze_tbl
}

package "Transformation and Quality" {
  component "Silver Job\nsrc/jobs/silver_transform.py" as silver_job
  database "Delta Table\nmain.poc_fintech.silver_transactions" as silver_tbl
  component "DLT SQL Pipeline\ndlt/pipeline.sql" as dlt_pipeline
}

package "KPI and Serving Layer" {
  component "Gold Job\nsrc/jobs/gold_kpi.py" as gold_job
  database "Delta Table\nmain.poc_fintech.gold_customer_kpi" as gold_tbl
  component "Customer 360 View\nsql/analytics/customer_360.sql" as customer360
  component "Risk Features View\nsql/analytics/risk_features.sql" as risk_view
}

package "MLOps Integration" {
  component "Train Risk Model\nsrc/mlops/train_risk_model.py" as ml_train
  component "Register Model\nsrc/mlops/register_model.py" as ml_register
  component "Batch Scoring\nsrc/mlops/batch_score.py" as ml_score
  database "MLflow Experiment\n/Shared/poc-fintech-risk-model" as ml_exp
  database "UC Model Registry\nmain.poc_fintech.risk_score_model" as ml_registry
  database "Scored Output\nrisk_scores_output.csv / scored table" as ml_output
}

package "GenAI / Databricks Genie Integration" {
  component "Genie Prompt Template\nsrc/ai/genie/genie_analyst_prompt.md" as genie_prompt
  component "Semantic Layer\nconfig/genie/semantic_layer.yaml" as genie_semantic
  component "Genie Space / LLM Assistant\n(analytics Q&A)" as genie_space
}

package "Platform Provisioning and Governance" {
  component "Terraform\ninfra/terraform/*.tf" as terraform
  component "Unity Catalog Schema + Grants\n(databricks_schema, databricks_grants)" as uc_controls
  component "Cluster Policy + Job Permissions\n(databricks_cluster_policy,\ndatabricks_permissions)" as platform_controls
}

package "CI/CD and Deployment" {
  component "Jenkins Pipeline\njenkins/Jenkinsfile" as jenkins
  component "Databricks Asset Bundle\ndatabricks.yml" as bundle
  component "One-command Demo Runner\nscripts/demo_run.ps1" as demo_script
  component "Unit Tests\ntests/test_transformations.py" as tests
  component "MLOps Tests/Validation\n(model metrics + checks)" as ml_checks
}

' Data flow
raw_file --> bronze_job : Ingest CSV
bronze_job --> bronze_tbl : Write Delta (append)

bronze_tbl --> silver_job : Read bronze records
silver_job --> silver_tbl : Clean + standardize\n(default currency, status normalization)

silver_tbl --> gold_job : Aggregate per customer
gold_job --> gold_tbl : Compute KPIs\n(txn_count, total, avg, failed_ratio)

gold_tbl --> customer360 : Build BI view
gold_tbl --> risk_view : Build risk feature view

customer360 --> consumer : Customer analytics
risk_view --> consumer : Risk signals for scoring/monitoring

' MLOps flow
risk_view --> ml_train : Feature input for training
ml_train --> ml_exp : Log params/metrics/artifacts
ml_train --> ml_register : Produce best run_id
ml_register --> ml_registry : Register governed model version
ml_registry --> ml_score : Load production model
risk_view --> ml_score : Feature input for inference
ml_score --> ml_output : Write risk predictions
ml_output --> ml_consumer : Prioritized review queue / actions

' Genie/LLM flow
customer360 --> genie_space : Queryable business metrics
risk_view --> genie_space : Queryable risk indicators
genie_prompt --> genie_space : Guardrails and response policy
genie_semantic --> genie_space : Business definitions and entity mapping
genie_space --> consumer : Natural language answers + explainability

' Data quality and alternative pipeline pattern
bronze_tbl --> dlt_pipeline : DLT source
dlt_pipeline --> silver_tbl : Quality-ready transformation pattern
dlt_pipeline --> gold_tbl : Managed pipeline style

' Platform and deployment relations
engineer --> demo_script : Run interview demo
demo_script --> tests : Execute local quality gate
demo_script --> terraform : Apply infra

jenkins --> tests : CI test stage
jenkins --> ml_checks : Model validation gate
jenkins --> terraform : IaC plan/apply
jenkins --> bundle : Deploy jobs as code
bundle --> bronze_job : Package/deploy
bundle --> silver_job : Package/deploy
bundle --> gold_job : Package/deploy
bundle --> ml_train : Package/deploy
bundle --> ml_score : Package/deploy

terraform --> uc_controls : Provision governance baseline
terraform --> platform_controls : Enforce operational guardrails
platform_controls --> bronze_job : Controlled runtime
platform_controls --> silver_job : Controlled runtime
platform_controls --> gold_job : Controlled runtime
uc_controls --> bronze_tbl : Access governance
uc_controls --> silver_tbl : Access governance
uc_controls --> gold_tbl : Access governance

note right of bronze_job
Functional explain:
- Landing zone for raw events
- Adds ingest timestamp
- Preserves source-like structure for traceability
end note

note right of silver_job
Functional explain:
- Applies data quality rules
- Handles nulls and invalid statuses
- Produces standardized curated dataset
end note

note right of gold_job
Functional explain:
- Converts transactions into customer KPIs
- Supports product analytics and risk analytics
- Creates reusable feature foundation
end note

note right of ml_train
Functional explain:
- Trains baseline risk classifier with MLflow tracking
- Captures reproducibility (params, metrics, artifacts)
- Produces run lineage for model governance
end note

note right of ml_register
Functional explain:
- Registers approved model into UC model registry
- Enables stage-based promotion and access control
- Provides audit-ready model lifecycle management
end note

note right of genie_space
Functional explain:
- Enables natural-language analytics over governed views
- Uses semantic metadata for consistent KPI definitions
- Applies prompt guardrails for safer business responses
end note

note bottom of terraform
Functional explain:
- Reproducible environment setup
- Declarative governance and permissions
- Reduces manual drift and deployment risk
end note

note bottom of jenkins
Functional explain:
- CI quality gates (tests)
- Automated infra deployment
- Repeatable delivery workflow for team scaling
end note

note bottom of consumer
Q&A angle:
- "How do you ensure quality?" -> Silver + tests + DLT pattern
- "How do you ensure governance?" -> UC grants + policy + permissions
- "How do you deploy safely?" -> Jenkins + Terraform + Bundle
- "How do you operationalize ML?" -> MLflow + Registry + validation gates
- "How do you apply GenAI safely?" -> Genie + semantic layer + prompt guardrails
end note

@enduml
